# Admin JavaScript (Vue 2)

Sin bundler, sin `import`/`export`. Vue, jQuery (`$`), Materialize (`M`) y `mixins` son globales. Fuente: `resources/`. Tras cambiar JS: `npm run build` (copia a `public/js/`). El panel carga `resources/components/*.js` directo.

```javascript
var PagesLists = new Vue({
  el: "#root",
  mixins: [mixins],
  data: { pages: [], loader: true },
  methods: {
    getPages: function () {
      var self = this;
      $.ajax({
        type: "GET",
        url: BASEURL + "api/v1/pages/",
        dataType: "json",
        success: function (response) {
          self.pages = (response && response.data) ? response.data : [];
          self.loader = false;
        },
        error: function () {
          M.toast({ html: "Ocurrió un error inesperado" });
          self.loader = false;
        },
      });
    },
  },
});
```

- Globals: `BASEURL`, `DEBUGMODE`, `mixins` (`resources/js/start.js`).
- Éxito API: `response.code == 200` y `response.data`.
- Materialize: inicializa plugins en `$nextTick` (`self.initPlugins()` del mixin). No `M.AutoInit()` global.
- SCSS del admin: `resources/scss/admin/`. Compilar con `npm run build` / `npm run watch`.
